{
  "//": [
    "Every table in the app, declared once. scripts/compile-tables.mjs writes the X and Width of",
    "each named cell into power/canvas/build/Src after scripts/assemble-canvas.mjs has put the",
    "screens there, and preflight check 20 fails if what is in build/Src is not what the compiler",
    "would write. Column widths are never hand-written in power/app (power/RUNBOOK.md, 'Table",
    "columns').",
    "",
    "A table: id, screen, the head container, the gallery, the row container inside it (or the",
    "gallery itself when the cells sit straight in the template), an optional foot container, the",
    "host card's padding as a formula, the gutter between cells, and the columns.",
    "A column: key, type, the role its cells read as, which every column declares and which is one",
    "of name, text, number, money, percent, date, badge, meta and tone, nothing else; the role is",
    "what the compiler writes the Size, FontWeight, Color and Align from, with Wrap false and no",
    "AutoHeight (power/RUNBOOK.md, 'Typography'). A tone column keeps its Color and Fill: they are",
    "the screen's, and the compiler writes only the Size, the Align and the layout on its cells.",
    "Then an optional share and min (the type's",
    "defaults otherwise), the control",
    "named for each role (header, cell, foot; a list of controls when they stack), an optional",
    "indent for a cell that starts short of its column, an optional gap of its own, and repeat for",
    "a column that takes the same pitch more than once. A repeated column whose slot count is not",
    "fixed names the formula for it in count: repeat is then the most slots the settings allow and",
    "the column's whole share is spread over count of them."
  ],
